  "description": "Feeling down? Stop by Cunimaru – a cozy shop where souls waiting for reincarnation gather to reminisce about their happiest memories. Savor a warm cup of tea and join Ji-Un Lee, Cunimaru’s new owner, as she embarks on a journey of healing, both for herself and her new friends, while unraveling the mysteries of this whimsical afterlife retreat.\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
